<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">Nupe Kingdom</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Nupe</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Nupe Kingdom was a state in the middle <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/niger-river">Niger</a> region of present-day central <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nigeria">Nigeria</a>, north-east of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yoruba">Yoruba</a> country. It exerted persistent military pressure on the early <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oyo-empire">Oyo Empire</a>. Around 1535 the Nupe inflicted a severe defeat on Oyo, forcing its ruling dynasty into a long exile in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/borgu">Borgu</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/nupe-kingdom.jpg" alt="Nupe Kingdom" width="320" height="307" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: JelaniZ · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Place_of_Etsue_Nupe.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
